# THE RULE FOR THIS REPO'S OWN DATA, learned the expensive way downstream: ignore what a command
# can regenerate, KEEP what only a human can produce. Tiles are cut from boxes by a script and can
# be recut on demand; the judgement of which class each tile belongs to cannot be recovered from
# anything if it is lost. So the pixels go and the index stays, and any consumer of this package
# should split its own working data the same way.
tiles/
weights/
predictions/

# working ledgers - kept locally and in a private notes repo, never in a public one
TASKS.jsonl
WORKLOG.md
